[
  {
    "text": "When you fast,",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.26
  },
  {
    "text": "what actually happens?",
    "start": 1.26,
    "end": 3.1
  },
  {
    "text": "Well, you stop giving your body an energy source,",
    "start": 3.1,
    "end": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "and even though you stopped eating,",
    "start": 5.84,
    "end": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "your body didn't.",
    "start": 7.72,
    "end": 8.82
  },
  {
    "text": "It's just eating you instead.",
    "start": 8.82,
    "end": 10.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Yep,",
    "start": 10.84,
    "end": 11.48
  },
  {
    "text": "you heard that right.",
    "start": 11.48,
    "end": 12.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Once your blood sugar and insulin drop,",
    "start": 12.64,
    "end": 14.58
  },
  {
    "text": "your body flips on a survival switch",
    "start": 14.58,
    "end": 16.46
  },
  {
    "text": "called autophagy,",
    "start": 16.46,
    "end": 17.8
  },
  {
    "text": "which literally means self-eating,",
    "start": 17.8,
    "end": 19.92
  },
  {
    "text": "and starts hunting down senescent cells.",
    "start": 19.92,
    "end": 22.46
  },
  {
    "text": "These are broken, retired cells",
    "start": 22.46,
    "end": 24.2
  },
  {
    "text": "just squatting in your body rent free",
    "start": 24.2,
    "end": 26.28
  },
  {
    "text": "that can no longer do their job.",
    "start": 26.28,
    "end": 27.8
  },
  {
    "text": "They're technically alive,",
    "start": 27.8,
    "end": 29.68
  },
  {
    "text": "completely useless,",
    "start": 29.68,
    "end": 30.98
  },
  {
    "text": "and just sit there rotting",
    "start": 30.98,
    "end": 32.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and leaking inflammation.",
    "start": 32.08,
    "end": 33.74
  },
  {
    "text": "Basically,",
    "start": 33.74,
    "end": 34.28
  },
  {
    "text": "that one unemployed roommate who",
    "start": 34.28,
    "end": 35.84
  },
  {
    "text": "refuses to move out,",
    "start": 35.84,
    "end": 37.36
  },
  {
    "text": "and the exact reason you wake up feeling puffy,",
    "start": 37.36,
    "end": 40.22
  },
  {
    "text": "stiff, and 80 years old in your 20s.",
    "start": 40.22,
    "end": 43.24
  },
  {
    "text": "To get rid of that inflammation,",
    "start": 43.24,
    "end": 44.88
  },
  {
    "text": "your body literally cannibalizes them,",
    "start": 44.88,
    "end": 47.16
  },
  {
    "text": "stripping their junk parts down into",
    "start": 47.16,
    "end": 48.74
  },
  {
    "text": "amino acids,",
    "start": 48.74,
    "end": 49.96
  },
  {
    "text": "raw protein building blocks,",
    "start": 49.96,
    "end": 51.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and burning them for fuel,",
    "start": 51.6,
    "end": 53.12
  },
  {
    "text": "which finally clears out your brain fog,",
    "start": 53.12,
    "end": 54.9
  },
  {
    "text": "depuffs your face,",
    "start": 54.9,
    "end": 56.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and stops your joints from aching for no reason.",
    "start": 56.4,
    "end": 59.1
  },
  {
    "text": "Once your body finishes eating its own garbage,",
    "start": 59.1,
    "end": 62.1
  },
  {
    "text": "it flips into healing and repair mode,",
    "start": 62.1,
    "end": 64.16
  },
  {
    "text": "firing up your stem cells",
    "start": 64.16,
    "end": 65.4
  },
  {
    "text": "to replace those deadbeat cells",
    "start": 65.4,
    "end": 67.02
  },
  {
    "text": "with fresh, brand new, healthy ones,",
    "start": 67.02,
    "end": 69.44
  },
  {
    "text": "meaning tighter skin,",
    "start": 69.44,
    "end": 70.72
  },
  {
    "text": "faster recovery,",
    "start": 70.72,
    "end": 71.9
  },
  {
    "text": "and a gut that isn't constantly at war with itself.",
    "start": 71.9,
    "end": 75.4
  },
  {
    "text": "It's wild that your body does all that",
    "start": 75.4,
    "end": 77.26
  },
  {
    "text": "just because you locked your jaw for a few hours.",
    "start": 77.26,
    "end": 79.9
  },
  {
    "text": "Honestly,",
    "start": 79.9,
    "end": 80.78
  },
  {
    "text": "it's divine.",
    "start": 80.78,
    "end": 82.33333333333333
  }
]